2 CONC dt both new ships and repaired other ships including ships which had partly been wrecked along the shore. We exported lobsters, and had a fleet of minimum eight ships.  When Gabriel died about 1765 the his son Jochum became a part
2 CONC ner and the company expanded enough once. 
