1 OCCU  Veterinary Surgeon, MP for Hedmark, Norway. Lord of Pramhus manor Mayor of Eidskog
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Herre til Pramhus. Lord of the manor of Pramhus.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jørgen Martin Meldal-Johnsen (June 11, 1833-1814. May 1912) was a veterinarian and member of parliament from Kristiansand. Hans Johnsen was his father.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Jørgen graduated from the University of Copenhagen in 1849 and veterinary examination in the same city four years later. He was  from 1854-58 vet in his hometown, 1858-1872 amtsdyrlege in Solør. In 1871 he acquired  the manor and
2 CONC  estate  in Pramhus Eidskog and was  there until 1908. In Eidskog he was the  mayor for 20 years, and later on a conciliation commissioner.
2 CONT
2 CONT From 1898-1900 Jørgen was  one of 5 representatives from Hedmark county in Parliament. He was a member of  the Agriculture Committee. In 1908 he settled in Christiania, where he died four years later.   
2 CONT
2 CONT http://nn.wikipedia.org/wiki/J%C3%B8rgen_Johnsen
