1 OCCU Chilean consul and vice consul for Spain in Kristiansand, konsul for Chile og visekonsul for Spania. Han var også ridder av de spanske ordener Isabellaordenen og Carl den 3. orden
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hans jr took over the Hans Johnsen firma on the death of his father in 1872. Hans jr served as Consul for Chile and Vice Consul for Spain. He received a knighthood from the KIng of Spain and was inducted into the Q
2 CONC ueen Isabella order as well as the Order of Charles (Carlos) III. He was chairman of the Chamber of Commerce 1883, 1884 and 1887.
