2 _MARNM Randulf
1 NAME Niels Enevoldsen //
2 GIVN Niels Enevoldsen
2 SURN Randulf
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 20 AUG 1630
2 PLAC Roskilde, Sjælland, Denmark
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 MAY 1711
