2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT John Greig a brother Alexander Greig who was afisherman and a British Consul in Bergen Norway.  He married a Norwegian, MargaretheHeitman.  He died in 1803.  Theirson was John, born 1772 and married to Maren Haslund.  Their son wa
2 CONC s Alexander born 1806 and wasmarried to Juditte Gesine Hagerup. Their son was the famous Edvard Grieg (notechange in spelling of name).  He was born1843 and died 1907.  He was married toNina.  (These people apparently were theance
2 CONC stors of Glenn Gould.
