2 CONT * Children:	Elfride Petrine Bernhardine Vennehuld (born Boisen), Ana Vilhelmine Theodore Boisen, Peter Outzen Nannestad Boisen, Poul Thorvald Benedict Boisen, Thyra Dannebod Hartmann (born Boisen)
