1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Added by Erik Meldal-Johnsen 16th July 2026'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Caroline Mathilda Nilsdatter Mohr (b. 1854) was the daughter of sanitary director Nils Georg Mohr and Kristine Hjersing.
2 CONT She was the second wife of prominent doctor and politician Joseph Frantz Oscar Johnsen (1838-1905). They married in Kristiania on October 15th, 1874, and had two daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT (Source: https://lokalhistoriewiki.no/wiki/Joseph_Frantz_Oscar_Johnsen )
